{#
  The pricing section of an asset's own Réglages — the four configuration
  blocks of module spec §6.10.

  Each block is its own <form> posting to its own action (§6.4): saving the
  fees can never blank the grid, and vice versa.

  What a manager does here nine visits out of ten is READ the tariff, so
  every block is a read card with its own « Modifier »/« Ajouter » dialog
  (design.md §1.9). Five forms standing open meant five `btn-primary` on
  one screen; now the only primary on screen is the one belonging to
  whichever dialog is open.

  Requires `asset`, `pricing` (a Pricing\PricingSettings), `billing_units`,
  and optionally `simulation`.

  The simulator at the bottom stays a plain inline GET form: it is a
  question, not a setting, and its answer renders directly underneath. Its
  result is computed server-side by the same engine that prices the public
  page and the contract. That identity is the entire point — a client-side
  re-computation would be a guard-rail against nothing.
#}
<div class="card mb-4" id="tarification">
    <div class="card-body">
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-start gap-2 mb-1">
            <h2 class="h5 mb-0">Tarification</h2>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary"
                    data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#tarification-edit">
                <i class="bi bi-pencil" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                Modifier
            </button>
        </div>
        <p class="text-body-secondary small">
            C'est ici que se décide ce que paie un locataire&nbsp;: à la nuit, par personne
            et par nuit, au forfait ou à l'exemplaire, avec un tarif par période et par
            catégorie, un minimum facturable et des frais (nettoyage, taxe de séjour,
            relevé de compteur). Le simulateur en bas de section montre le résultat exact
            que verra un visiteur.
        </p>

        <dl class="row mb-0">
            <dt class="col-sm-5 col-lg-4">Unité de facturation</dt>
            <dd class="col-sm-7 col-lg-8">
                {{ pricing.billingUnit.label }}
                <span class="form-text d-block">{{ pricing.billingUnit.availabilityExplanation }}</span>
            </dd>

            <dt class="col-sm-5 col-lg-4">Tarif par défaut</dt>
            <dd class="col-sm-7 col-lg-8">
                {% if pricing.defaultUnitPriceCents is not null %}
                    {{ pricing.defaultUnitPriceCents|money_cents }}
                {% else %}
                    <span class="text-body-secondary">Aucun — la grille ci-dessous doit tout couvrir.</span>
                {% endif %}
            </dd>

            <dt class="col-sm-5 col-lg-4">Minimum facturable</dt>
            <dd class="col-sm-7 col-lg-8 mb-0">
                {% if pricing.minimumAmountCents is not null %}
                    {{ pricing.minimumAmountCents|money_cents }}
                {% elseif pricing.minimumPersons is not null %}
                    {{ pricing.minimumPersons }} personnes
                {% else %}
                    Aucun
                {% endif %}
            </dd>
        </dl>

        <hr>

        {# ── Block 2, axis 1: periods ─────────────────────────────────── #}
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2">
            <h3 class="h6 mb-0">Périodes tarifaires</h3>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary"
                    data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#periode-add">
                <i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                Ajouter une période
            </button>
        </div>
        <p class="form-text mt-0">
            Premier axe de la grille. Une période récurrente se répète chaque année et peut chevaucher
            le nouvel an (20 décembre → 5 janvier).
        </p>
        {% if pricing.periods is empty %}
            {% include 'partials/empty_state.html.twig' with {
                message: 'Aucune période tarifaire.', compact: true,
            } only %}
        {% else %}
            <ul class="list-group mb-4">
                {% for period in pricing.periods %}
                    <li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2">
                        <span>
                            <span class="fw-semibold">{{ period.label }}</span>
                            <span class="text-body-secondary small d-block">
                                {{ period.startDate|date_fr }} → {{ period.endDate|date_fr }}{{ period.recursYearly ? ' · chaque année' : '' }}
                            </span>
                        </span>
                        <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/{{ asset.slug }}/reglages/periode-supprimer"
                              data-confirm="Supprimer cette période ? Ses tarifs seront supprimés avec elle.">
                            {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
                            <input type="hidden" name="period_id" value="{{ period.id }}">
                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger">Supprimer</button>
                        </form>
                    </li>
                {% endfor %}
            </ul>
        {% endif %}

        {# ── Block 2, axis 2: renter categories ───────────────────────── #}
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2">
            <h3 class="h6 mb-0">Catégories de locataire</h3>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary"
                    data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#categorie-add">
                <i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                Ajouter une catégorie
            </button>
        </div>
        <p class="form-text mt-0">
            Second axe de la grille : mouvement de jeunesse, ASBL, particulier, entreprise, interne…
        </p>
        {% if pricing.categories is empty %}
            {% include 'partials/empty_state.html.twig' with {
                message: 'Aucune catégorie de locataire.', compact: true,
            } only %}
        {% else %}
            <ul class="list-group mb-4">
                {% for category in pricing.categories %}
                    <li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2">
                        <span>
                            {{ category.label }}
                            {% if category.isDefault %}
                                <span class="badge bg-body-tertiary border text-body-secondary">Proposée par défaut</span>
                            {% endif %}
                        </span>
                        <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/{{ asset.slug }}/reglages/categorie-supprimer"
                              data-confirm="Supprimer cette catégorie ? Ses tarifs seront supprimés avec elle.">
                            {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
                            <input type="hidden" name="category_id" value="{{ category.id }}">
                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger">Supprimer</button>
                        </form>
                    </li>
                {% endfor %}
            </ul>
        {% endif %}

        {# ── Block 2: the grid itself ─────────────────────────────────── #}
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2">
            <h3 class="h6 mb-0">Grille des prix unitaires</h3>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary"
                    data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#grille-edit">
                <i class="bi bi-pencil" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                Modifier la grille
            </button>
        </div>
        <p class="form-text mt-0">
            Deux axes, et deux seulement. Une case vide utilise le tarif par défaut ci-dessus.
        </p>
        {% set period_rows = pricing.periods is empty ? [null] : pricing.periods %}
        {% set category_cols = pricing.categories is empty ? [null] : pricing.categories %}
        <div class="table-responsive mb-4">
            <table class="table table-sm align-middle">
                <caption class="visually-hidden">Tarifs unitaires par période et par catégorie</caption>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th scope="col">Période</th>
                        {% if pricing.categories is empty %}
                            <th scope="col">Tarif</th>
                        {% else %}
                            {% for category in pricing.categories %}
                                <th scope="col">{{ category.label }}</th>
                            {% endfor %}
                        {% endif %}
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {% for period in period_rows %}
                        <tr>
                            <th scope="row" class="fw-normal">
                                {{ period ? period.label : 'Toute l\'année' }}
                            </th>
                            {% for category in category_cols %}
                                {% set key = (period ? period.id : 0) ~ ':' ~ (category ? category.id : 0) %}
                                {% set cents = pricing.priceGridCents[key] ?? null %}
                                <td>
                                    {% if cents is not null %}
                                        {{ cents|money_cents }}
                                    {% else %}
                                        <span class="text-body-secondary">—</span>
                                    {% endif %}
                                </td>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </tr>
                    {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        {# ── Block 4: fees ────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2">
            <h3 class="h6 mb-0">Frais</h3>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary"
                    data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#frais-add">
                <i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                Ajouter un frais
            </button>
        </div>
        <p class="form-text mt-0">
            Trois natures seulement. Un frais au compteur n'entre <strong>jamais</strong> dans le devis :
            son montant vient du relevé réel, après le séjour.
        </p>
        {% if pricing.fees is empty %}
            {% include 'partials/empty_state.html.twig' with {
                message: 'Aucun frais.', compact: true,
            } only %}
        {% else %}
            <ul class="list-group mb-4">
                {% for fee in pricing.fees %}
                    <li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2">
                        <span>
                            <span class="fw-semibold">{{ fee.label }}</span>
                            <span class="text-body-secondary small d-block">
                                {{ fee.natureLabel }} ·
                                {{ fee.amountCents|money_cents }}{{ fee.meterUnit ? ' / ' ~ fee.meterUnit : '' }}
                            </span>
                        </span>
                        <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/{{ asset.slug }}/reglages/frais-supprimer"
                              data-confirm="Supprimer ce frais ? Il disparaît des prochains devis ; les réservations en cours gardent le leur.">
                            {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
                            <input type="hidden" name="fee_id" value="{{ fee.id }}">
                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger">Supprimer</button>
                        </form>
                    </li>
                {% endfor %}
            </ul>
        {% endif %}

        <hr>

        {# ── Simulator ────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
        <h3 class="h6">Simulateur</h3>
        <p class="form-text mt-0">
            Le calcul ci-dessous utilise exactement le même moteur que la page publique et le contrat.
            C'est le principal garde-fou contre une configuration tarifaire fausse.
        </p>
        <form method="get" action="/mes-locations/{{ asset.slug }}/reglages" class="row g-2 align-items-end mb-3">
            <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                    field_id: 'sim-arrival', field_name: 'sim_arrival', type: 'date',
                    label: 'Arrivée', wrapper_class: 'mb-0',
                    value: simulation ? simulation.request.arrivalDate : '',
                } only %}
            </div>
            <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                    field_id: 'sim-departure', field_name: 'sim_departure', type: 'date',
                    label: 'Départ', wrapper_class: 'mb-0',
                    value: simulation ? simulation.request.departureDate : '',
                } only %}
            </div>
            <div class="col-4 col-md-2">
                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                    field_id: 'sim-persons', field_name: 'sim_persons', type: 'number',
                    label: 'Participants', min: 0, inputmode: 'numeric', wrapper_class: 'mb-0',
                    value: simulation ? simulation.request.persons : '',
                } only %}
            </div>
            <div class="col-4 col-md-2">
                {# The empty option is the "no category" choice, not a
                   placeholder: the simulator legitimately prices without one. #}
                {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                    field_id: 'sim-category', field_name: 'sim_category', type: 'select',
                    label: 'Catégorie', wrapper_class: 'mb-0',
                    options: [{ value: '', label: '—' }]|merge(pricing.categories|map(c => {
                        value: c.id,
                        label: c.label,
                        selected: simulation and simulation.request.renterCategoryId == c.id,
                    })),
                } only %}
            </div>
            <div class="col-4 col-md-2">
                {# A question, not a setting: the answer renders right
                   underneath, and this screen's primary belongs to whichever
                   editing dialog is open. #}
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-secondary w-100">Calculer</button>
            </div>
        </form>

        {% if simulation %}
            {% set quote = simulation.quote %}
            <div class="card bg-body-tertiary">
                <div class="card-body">
                    {% for warning in quote.warnings %}
                        <div class="alert alert-warning py-2 small mb-2" role="alert">{{ warning }}</div>
                    {% endfor %}

                    <div class="table-responsive">
                    <table class="table table-sm mb-2">
                        <caption class="visually-hidden">Détail du prix simulé</caption>
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th scope="col">Ligne</th>
                                <th scope="col" class="text-end">Quantité</th>
                                <th scope="col" class="text-end">Prix unitaire</th>
                                <th scope="col" class="text-end">Montant</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            {% for line in quote.lines %}
                                <tr{% if line.isInformational %} class="text-body-secondary fst-italic"{% endif %}>
                                    <td>{{ line.label }}</td>
                                    <td class="text-end">{{ line.isInformational ? '—' : line.quantity }}</td>
                                    <td class="text-end">
                                        {{ line.unitPriceCents is not null
                                            ? line.unitPriceCents|money_cents
                                            : '—' }}
                                    </td>
                                    <td class="text-end">
                                        {{ line.isInformational
                                            ? 'Selon relevé'
                                            : line.amountCents|money_cents }}
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            {% else %}
                                {% include 'partials/empty_state.html.twig' with {
                                    message: 'Aucune ligne calculable.',
                                    compact: true,
                                    colspan: 4,
                                } only %}
                            {% endfor %}
                        </tbody>
                        <tfoot>
                            <tr class="fw-semibold">
                                <th scope="row" colspan="3" class="text-end">Total</th>
                                <td class="text-end">{{ quote.totalCents|money_cents }}</td>
                            </tr>
                        </tfoot>
                    </table>
                    </div>

                    <p class="small text-body-secondary mb-0">
                        {{ quote.nights }} nuit{{ quote.nights > 1 ? 's' : '' }} ·
                        {{ quote.persons }} participant{{ quote.persons > 1 ? 's' : '' }} ·
                        quantité facturée : {{ quote.quantity }}
                        {%- if quote.period %} · période : {{ quote.period.label }}{% endif %}
                        {%- if quote.category %} · catégorie : {{ quote.category.label }}{% endif %}
                        {%- if quote.minimumApplied %} · <strong>minimum appliqué</strong>{% endif %}
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        {% endif %}
    </div>
</div>

{# The dialogs sit outside the card: a modal nested in one inherits its
   stacking context, and Bootstrap's backdrop then renders above the dialog
   it is meant to sit behind. #}

{# ── Block 1 + 3: billing unit, default rate, billable minimum ──────── #}
{% embed 'partials/modal.html.twig' with {
    id: 'tarification-edit',
    title: 'Modifier la tarification',
    section_editor: true,
    size: 'lg',
    asset: asset,
    pricing: pricing,
    billing_units: billing_units,
} only %}
    {% block body %}
        <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/{{ asset.slug }}/reglages/tarif" id="pricing-form">
            {{ csrf_field()|raw }}

            <div class="row g-3 mb-2">
                <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                    <label class="form-label" for="billing-unit">Unité de facturation</label>
                    {# Each option carries its own consequence text, rendered
                       from Pricing\BillingUnit so the server stays the single
                       source of truth; select-explanation.js only moves the
                       selected one into the note below. #}
                    <select class="form-select" id="billing-unit" name="billing_unit"
                            data-explanation-target="billing-unit-explanation">
                        {% for unit in billing_units %}
                            <option value="{{ unit.value }}"
                                    data-explanation="{{ unit.availabilityExplanation }}"
                                    {{ pricing.billingUnit.value == unit.value ? 'selected' : '' }}>
                                {{ unit.label }}
                            </option>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </select>
                    <div class="form-text" id="billing-unit-explanation">
                        {{ pricing.billingUnit.availabilityExplanation }}
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                    {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                        field_id: 'default-unit-price', field_name: 'default_unit_price',
                        label: 'Tarif par défaut (€)', inputmode: 'decimal',
                        help: 'Utilisé quand la grille n\'a pas de case pour la période et la
                               catégorie concernées. Laissez vide si toute la grille est remplie.',
                        value: pricing.defaultUnitPriceCents is not null ? (pricing.defaultUnitPriceCents / 100)|number_format(2, ',', ' ') : '',
                    } only %}
                </div>
            </div>

            <fieldset class="mb-0">
                <legend class="form-label">Minimum facturable</legend>
                <p class="form-text mt-0">
                    Un montant plancher <strong>ou</strong> un nombre de personnes plancher — jamais les
                    deux. Ce seul champ remplace les tranches d'occupation et le « prix de base incluant
                    N personnes ».
                </p>
                <div class="form-check">
                    <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="minimum_mode" id="minimum-none"
                           value="none" {{ not pricing.hasMinimum ? 'checked' : '' }}>
                    <label class="form-check-label" for="minimum-none">Aucun minimum</label>
                </div>
                <div class="form-check">
                    <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="minimum_mode" id="minimum-amount-mode"
                           value="amount" {{ pricing.minimumAmountCents is not null ? 'checked' : '' }}>
                    <label class="form-check-label" for="minimum-amount-mode">Montant minimum (€)</label>
                    <input type="text" inputmode="decimal" class="form-control mt-1" name="minimum_amount"
                           aria-label="Montant minimum en euros"
                           value="{{ pricing.minimumAmountCents is not null ? (pricing.minimumAmountCents / 100)|number_format(2, ',', ' ') : '' }}">
                </div>
                <div class="form-check">
                    <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="minimum_mode" id="minimum-persons-mode"
                           value="persons" {{ pricing.minimumPersons is not null ? 'checked' : '' }}>
                    <label class="form-check-label" for="minimum-persons-mode">Nombre de personnes minimum</label>
                    <input type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="1" class="form-control mt-1" name="minimum_persons"
                           aria-label="Nombre de personnes minimum"
                           value="{{ pricing.minimumPersons ?? '' }}">
                    <div class="form-text">
                        Ne s'applique qu'à un tarif par personne. La ligne du devis affichera
                        explicitement « 25 pers. (minimum) × 3 nuits ».
                    </div>
                </div>
            </fieldset>
        </form>
    {% endblock %}
    {% block footer %}
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Annuler</button>
        <button type="submit" form="pricing-form" class="btn btn-primary">Enregistrer la tarification</button>
    {% endblock %}
{% endembed %}

{% embed 'partials/modal.html.twig' with {
    id: 'periode-add',
    title: 'Ajouter une période tarifaire',
    section_editor: true,
    asset: asset,
} only %}
    {% block body %}
        <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/{{ asset.slug }}/reglages/periode" id="period-form">
            {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
            {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                field_id: 'period-label', field_name: 'label',
                label: 'Nom', required: true,
            } only %}
            <div class="row g-3">
                <div class="col-6">
                    {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                        field_id: 'period-start', field_name: 'start_date', type: 'date',
                        label: 'Début', required: true,
                    } only %}
                </div>
                <div class="col-6">
                    {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                        field_id: 'period-end', field_name: 'end_date', type: 'date',
                        label: 'Fin', required: true,
                    } only %}
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="form-check">
                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="period-recurs" name="recurs_yearly">
                <label class="form-check-label" for="period-recurs">Chaque année</label>
            </div>
        </form>
    {% endblock %}
    {% block footer %}
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Annuler</button>
        <button type="submit" form="period-form" class="btn btn-primary">Ajouter</button>
    {% endblock %}
{% endembed %}

{% embed 'partials/modal.html.twig' with {
    id: 'categorie-add',
    title: 'Ajouter une catégorie de locataire',
    section_editor: true,
    asset: asset,
} only %}
    {% block body %}
        <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/{{ asset.slug }}/reglages/categorie" id="category-form">
            {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
            {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                field_id: 'category-label', field_name: 'label',
                label: 'Nom', required: true,
            } only %}
            <div class="form-check">
                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="category-default" name="is_default">
                <label class="form-check-label" for="category-default">Proposée par défaut</label>
            </div>
        </form>
    {% endblock %}
    {% block footer %}
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Annuler</button>
        <button type="submit" form="category-form" class="btn btn-primary">Ajouter</button>
    {% endblock %}
{% endembed %}

{% embed 'partials/modal.html.twig' with {
    id: 'grille-edit',
    title: 'Modifier la grille des prix',
    section_editor: true,
    size: 'xl',
    scrollable: true,
    asset: asset,
    pricing: pricing,
} only %}
    {% block body %}
        <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/{{ asset.slug }}/reglages/grille" id="grid-form">
            {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
            <p class="form-text mt-0">
                Une case laissée vide utilise le tarif par défaut du bien.
            </p>
            <div class="table-responsive">
                <table class="table table-sm align-middle">
                    <caption class="visually-hidden">Tarifs unitaires par période et par catégorie</caption>
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th scope="col">Période</th>
                            {% if pricing.categories is empty %}
                                <th scope="col">Tarif</th>
                            {% else %}
                                {% for category in pricing.categories %}
                                    <th scope="col">{{ category.label }}</th>
                                {% endfor %}
                            {% endif %}
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        {% set period_rows = pricing.periods is empty ? [null] : pricing.periods %}
                        {% set category_cols = pricing.categories is empty ? [null] : pricing.categories %}
                        {% for period in period_rows %}
                            <tr>
                                <th scope="row" class="fw-normal">
                                    {{ period ? period.label : 'Toute l\'année' }}
                                </th>
                                {% for category in category_cols %}
                                    {% set key = (period ? period.id : 0) ~ ':' ~ (category ? category.id : 0) %}
                                    {% set cents = pricing.priceGridCents[key] ?? null %}
                                    <td>
                                        <label class="visually-hidden" for="grid-{{ key|replace({':': '-'}) }}">
                                            Tarif {{ period ? period.label : 'toute l\'année' }}
                                            {{ category ? '· ' ~ category.label : '' }}
                                        </label>
                                        <input type="text" inputmode="decimal" class="form-control form-control-sm"
                                               id="grid-{{ key|replace({':': '-'}) }}"
                                               name="grid[{{ key }}]"
                                               value="{{ cents is not null ? (cents / 100)|number_format(2, ',', ' ') : '' }}">
                                    </td>
                                {% endfor %}
                            </tr>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </form>
    {% endblock %}
    {% block footer %}
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Annuler</button>
        <button type="submit" form="grid-form" class="btn btn-primary">Enregistrer la grille</button>
    {% endblock %}
{% endembed %}

{% embed 'partials/modal.html.twig' with {
    id: 'frais-add',
    title: 'Ajouter un frais',
    section_editor: true,
    asset: asset,
} only %}
    {% block body %}
        <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/{{ asset.slug }}/reglages/frais" id="fee-form">
            {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
            {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                field_id: 'fee-label', field_name: 'label',
                label: 'Libellé', required: true,
            } only %}
            <div class="row g-3">
                <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                    {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                        field_id: 'fee-nature', field_name: 'nature', type: 'select',
                        label: 'Nature',
                        options: [
                            { value: 'fixed', label: 'Montant fixe' },
                            { value: 'per_person', label: 'Montant par personne' },
                            { value: 'meter', label: 'Relevé de compteur' },
                        ],
                    } only %}
                </div>
                <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
                    {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                        field_id: 'fee-amount', field_name: 'amount',
                        label: 'Montant (€)', inputmode: 'decimal', required: true,
                    } only %}
                </div>
                <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
                    {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                        field_id: 'fee-meter-unit', field_name: 'meter_unit',
                        label: 'Unité', placeholder: 'kWh',
                        help: 'Compteur uniquement.',
                    } only %}
                </div>
            </div>
        </form>
    {% endblock %}
    {% block footer %}
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Annuler</button>
        <button type="submit" form="fee-form" class="btn btn-primary">Ajouter</button>
    {% endblock %}
{% endembed %}
